## 🗺️ Upcoming Milestones (The Full Roadmap)

### Tensor Core Saturation (Phase 4)
- [ ] Replace custom matrix multiplication loops with NVIDIA's CUTLASS library.
- [ ] Implement Epilogue Visitor Trees (EVT) to fuse GEMM, bias, and ReLU into a single kernel natively in `__nv_bfloat16`.

### Production VRAM Management (Phase 5)
- [ ] Eliminate slow, blocking `cudaMalloc` calls by implementing `cudaMallocAsync`.
- [ ] Build a custom PyTorch-style Best-Fit with Coalescing (BFC) caching allocator in C++ userspace.

### PagedAttention & KV Caching (Phase 6)
- [ ] Implement OS-style virtual memory paging for VRAM (PagedAttention) to eliminate fragmentation during GPT-style generation.
- [ ] Enable Copy-On-Write (COW) for system prompt caching to slash Time-to-First-Token (TTFT).

### Zero-Overhead Dispatch & CUDA Graphs (Phase 7)
- [ ] Wrap training loops in CUDA Graphs to reduce CPU kernel-launch overhead to zero.
- [ ] Implement an ATen-style dispatcher to decouple tensor handles from hardware execution logic.

### Orchestrator Polish
- [ ] Wire up the stubbed "Use it" (inference phase) path in `main.cpp`.
- [ ] Wire up the stubbed "Add media" path in `main.cpp`.
